  "worked_solution": "Multiplying both sides of the given equality by $(x+1)^{2}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3x-1 & =A(x+1)-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLetting $x=0$  gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(0)-1 & =A(0+1)-4 \\\\ -1 & =A-4 \\\\ A & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
